rect ritual and cleanse the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and success rate will lead to one of 5 different endings. Replay to discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Dread, No Jumpscares:</strong> The terror builds from the oppressive atmosphere and sound design, not cheap startling tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A single playthrough lasts between 30-90 minutes, perfect for a concentrated dose of horror.</p></li></ul>","developers":["RenStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/46723f1e81b37f2a876fe2a554791a6d93113f62/header.jpg?t=1755832279","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846620/393377385/c9dd42f04c8b8363c7685de69d6884c2eb7e983c/1753244521/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755832278","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846620/393377385/c9dd42f04c8b8363c7685de69d6884c2eb7e983c/1753244521/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755832278","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846620/393377385/c9dd42f04c8b8363c7685de69d6884c2eb7e983c/1753244521/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755832278","id":257163307,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163307/movie480.mp4?t=1755832278","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163307/movie_max.mp4?t=1755832278"},"name":"new404","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163307/d047a92d48bb211307d8a216f3bb433989adf20e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755832278","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163307/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755832278","max":"https:/